    "name": "WalletWise API",
    "description": "Synthetic end-to-end examples for the WalletWise REST API. Select the WalletWise Local environment and run folders in order. Access tokens stay in collection variables; refresh cookies stay in Postman's cookie jar. Never export real tokens or production credentials.",
